# Trivy exceptions for the CI image scan (.github/workflows/ci.yml).
# One CVE id per line, each with a comment: why it does not apply, and when to
# revisit it. Keep this list short; fixing (upgrading) is always preferred.

# nginx 1.30.6 in nginxinc/nginx-unprivileged:stable-alpine (fixed in 1.30.7, not yet
# in the base image; `apk upgrade` cannot update it because nginx comes from the
# nginx.org repository, not Alpine's). None applies to our configuration: the
# frontend nginx only serves plain HTTP/1.1 on port 8080 behind the Gateway
# (frontend/nginx/default.conf.template: no mail proxy, no http2, no http3/quic).
# Revisit by the expiry date: remove these lines once the base image ships 1.30.7.
CVE-2026-113425 exp:2026-12-31
CVE-2026-121810 exp:2026-12-31
CVE-2026-123007 exp:2026-12-31
CVE-2026-123633 exp:2026-12-31
